	(text "12.1 V, 11 mA. On the battery side, so regen through the body diodes keeps it up with the BMS open. Runs the latch and the clamp. 0.5 W at 54.6 V.\nFed through F1 with its own 1 uF, clamped by a 15 V TVS, reverse diode OUT to IN: block 10."
