	(text "SPARE_SW: RUN enables it, so it drops with the motor bank. The divider keeps 7.7 V of RUN under the 6 V EN limit. Limit 3.87-4.42 A (487R). dV/dt 3.3\nnF: about 12 V/ms. One switch: a shorted U9 stays on. Current and volts at 0x47, 5 mOhm, ADCRANGE 1.\nSPARE_ON: block 8a. Both spares sit behind RS8, so the 12 V meter counts them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
