	(text "Low means pressed. Pi GPIO input, no Pi pull-up needed. 3.3 V through 3.3k gives the contact 1 mA of wetting.\nA harness short to the 54.6 V bus: the BAT46W blocks the pull-up (block 10), and 100k leaves 0.5 mA in the clamp pair. Open contact reads about 3.0 V.\nInformation only: the NC loop does the stopping."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 355.6 566 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "27864ac7-3d1e-54c3-9413-33ef48017af8")
	)
